Appica's theme settings panel: mode, base / primary / secondary colors, font and radius, with "Get CSS Code",
"Disable animations" and a reset. A **block** composed from [Toggle Group](<%= page_path(:toggle_group) %>),
[Select](<%= page_path(:select) %>), [Input](<%= page_path(:input) %>), [Switch](<%= page_path(:switch) %>),
[Dialog](<%= page_path(:dialog) %>) and Copy Button. Every change repaints this page **and every other Lookbook
preview**, even in other tabs - the choice is kept in your browser until you reset it.

